    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Master your movement, shooting, and skills to overcome waves that grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Explore through the universe </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new universe full of discoveries in each round. Utilize the intervals between alien waves to harvest resources from nearby planets, preparing for the battles ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a spaceship and strategically select artifacts, talents and items. The game offers countless possibilities, enabling you to dictate your playstyle to ensure a unique and engaging experience with every session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A dynamically generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars, black holes, aliens, and wonders to discover, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts (and more) that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong>\u00a0Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more:\u00a0</strong>Missions, unlockables, and surprises await.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Master your movement, shooting, and skills to overcome waves that grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/92653c6df45fdd2f609fab832bd30e9f.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Explore through the universe </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new universe full of discoveries in each round. Utilize the intervals between alien waves to harvest resources from nearby planets, preparing for the battles ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/291d7f2dcf07c9f3bc67e8346c8d1bba.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a spaceship and strategically select artifacts, talents and items. The game offers countless possibilities, enabling you to dictate your playstyle to ensure a unique and engaging experience with every session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/695073c2a2f9a333fcf373ded6911d90.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/524dcc23abf0bf467b997dbd99d7ffb2.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.poster.avif?t=1753050793\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.webm?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/11781fcb74198a9e115add19e4d4d9e0.mp4?t=1753050793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A dynamically generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars, black holes, aliens, and wonders to discover, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts (and more) that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong>\u00a0Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more:\u00a0</strong>Missions, unlockables, and surprises await.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arcadium is a survival roguelite set in a dynamic, ever-changing universe. Journey across space, harvest planetary resources, and craft powerful builds to eradicate relentless waves of aliens. Each playthrough unveils a new and uncharted universe, ensuring endless challenges and discoveries.",
